35,2,1,talk,May,,"@Kenji, the narrowest frontage is only ninety centimetres. That’s a nightmare to maintain. We need a plan that doesn’t burn us out.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, ninety centimetres is a trap. The ledger proves the current setup fails. We must ensure the new location doesn’t replicate that unequal burden.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@May, ninety centimetres is tiny! But the ledger shows we waste thirty-four thousand yen yearly on open bags. We need a spot that stops that leak.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, the minutes show they argued over a latch within two years. We need a plan that doesn’t turn us into enemies again.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@May, the truck arrives before we wake. The log shows one household filed eleven of fourteen complaints. We must design a rhythm that respects our sleep and our peace.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Servas, eleven complaints from one household? That’s not a rhythm, that’s a hostage situation. We need a system that doesn’t rely on one person’s patience.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Servas, exactly. Eleven complaints from one household is a failure of design, not character. We must ensure the new arrangement doesn’t replicate that unequal burden.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, that’s a huge imbalance! But my ledger shows we waste thirty-four thousand yen yearly on open bags. We need a spot that stops that leak before it eats our budget.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, I hear you. But the residents said nobody wants to be the enforcer. We need a system that doesn’t force us to police each other.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
